#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:5
#: 425ff1fd4fea4bafbc421151bfb84a38
msgid "Understanding Altitude in ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中高度的理解"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:7
#: 4a7d1c164bdf4d2c952090a7c2a86cce
msgid ""
"ArduPilot documentation uses the word \"altitude\" often and in many "
"different ways and contexts. Not all \"altitudes\" mean the same thing, and "
"a good understanding of what altitude means in any given context is "
"important to understand expected operation and behavior."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"文档中频繁使用「高度」一词，且在不同场合含义各异。并非所有「高度」的含义相同，充分理解不同语境下高度的含义对于理解预期操作和行为非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:14
#: b313d797de3f4dc1ab7ae2b6ee3f210c
msgid ""
"ORIGIN and HOME are set during ground initialization from the GPS and are "
"usually the same location, but the user may move the HOME location during "
"the flight via Mission Planner (for a different RTL point), but the Origin "
"always remains the same unless intentionally reset."
msgstr ""
"ORIGIN 和 Home 在地面初始化期间由 GPS 设置，通常是同一位置，但用户可以在飞行中通过 Mission Planner 移动 Home "
"位置（用于不同的 RTL 点），而 Origin 始终保持不变，除非被有意重置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:18
#: 39a7d7c7e5524394a88e5f000f7354c2
msgid "Definitions of Altitude (ALT)"
msgstr "高度（ALT）的定义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:20
#: f1a6d0c98ba84156be5abb7f358ae1ad
msgid "In the above diagram, various types of \"altitude\" are shown:"
msgstr "在上图中，展示了各种类型的「高度」："

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:22
#: 61fdac80f9274a499b94442397d45cbb
msgid ""
"ASL: Altitude above (mean) Sea Level - the altitude of the vehicle expressed"
" as distance above the mean sea level of the world."
msgstr "ASL：海拔高度（平均海平面以上高度）——飞行器相对于世界平均海平面的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:23
#: 503457f028254bed806f425e03d40b81
msgid ""
"AGL: Altitude above Ground Level: the altitude of the vehicle above whatever"
" is directly below it."
msgstr "AGL：地面以上高度——飞行器相对于其正下方地面的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:24
#: f89094a913d442a3bd917ffdcbc56c97
msgid ""
"Relative: Relative altitude above HOME/ORIGIN position's altitude. This is "
"what is displayed in the ground station and OSD as the vehicle's altitude."
msgstr "相对高度：相对于 Home/ORIGIN 位置高度的高度。这是地面站和 OSD 中显示的飞行器高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:25
#: ece02386148c4c568370200509546b85
msgid ""
"Terrain ALT: The height above sea level (asl) of a terrain position. This "
"sometimes, but not always includes, any natural or man-made additions to the"
" terrain's ground altitude."
msgstr "地形高度（Terrain ALT）：某地形位置的海拔高度（ASL）。这有时但不总是包括对地形地面高度的自然或人为增加量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:26
#: ee011c8b185440cfa0e601d5727d9c57
msgid ""
"Estimated ALT: The autopilot's estimation of vehicle Relative altitude above"
" ORIGIN which is used internally by the vehicle's Altitude Controller to "
"maintain or obtain the Target ALT in altitude controlled modes (Plane: "
"FBWB/AUTO/GUIDED/CRUISE/LOITER/CIRCLE), Copter: "
"ALTHOLD/CIRCLE/LOITER/GUIDED/AUTO/DRIFT)"
msgstr ""
"估计高度（Estimated ALT）：飞控对飞行器相对于 ORIGIN "
"的相对高度的估算，由飞行器的高度控制器在高度控制模式下用于维持或达到目标高度（Plane：FBWB/AUTO/GUIDED/CRUISE/LOITER/CIRCLE，Copter：ALTHOLD/CIRCLE/LOITER/GUIDED/AUTO/DRIFT）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:27
#: 7f08ae6191134f68b5b699036328da5c
msgid ""
"Target ALT: The desired altitude in altitude controlled modes. Either from "
"pilot input (eg ALTHOLD) or from navigation controller (eg AUTO)"
msgstr "目标高度（Target ALT）：高度控制模式下的期望高度，来自飞手输入（如 ALTHOLD）或导航控制器（如 AUTO）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:31
#: c660ba6e001043f09b3a1d24b973966b
msgid "Estimated and Target ALT"
msgstr "估计高度与目标高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:38
#: efcf54809c404f6da25e8b25c9d8a631
msgid ""
"The above simplified diagram shows how altitude control is implemented in "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr "上述简化示意图展示了 ArduPilot 中高度控制的实现方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:40
#: 934f6656b1ab4ffcaa3532780df5f886
msgid ""
"The EKF subsystem is responsible for generating attitude, velocity, "
"position, and altitude estimates for the vehicle so that the navigation and "
"control systems can properly operate. EKF takes the IMU, GPS, and BARO "
"sensor inputs and integrates them to provide these estimates, one of which "
"is the Estimated ALT."
msgstr ""
"EKF 子系统负责为飞行器生成姿态、速度、位置和高度估计，以使导航和控制系统能够正常工作。EKF 综合 IMU、GPS "
"和气压计传感器输入并进行积分，提供这些估计，其中之一就是估计高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:42
#: 6ffb570bf8ab4a5790ce031c75c4baeb
msgid ""
"This is then fed to the vehicle's altitude control system, which attempts to"
" match the Target ALT in altitude controlled modes."
msgstr "然后将其馈送到飞行器的高度控制系统，在高度控制模式下尝试匹配目标高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:44
#: 05a1861be2154737a111dd8dba801984
msgid ""
"The Target ALT can come from many different sources depending on the vehicle"
" mode. For example, In Plane's FBWB mode, the pitch stick increases or "
"decreases the Target ALT, while in AUTO mode when navigating to a waypoint, "
"the navigation controller feeds a varying ramp of Target ALT as it "
"progresses toward the waypoint to reach that waypoint's new altitude, if "
"different from the previous waypoint's."
msgstr ""
"目标高度可以来自多种不同来源，取决于飞行器模式。例如，在 Plane 的 FBWB 模式中，俯仰摇杆增加或减少目标高度；在 AUTO "
"模式导航到航点时，导航控制器随着向航点推进而输入逐渐变化的目标高度斜坡，以达到该航点的新高度（如果与前一个航点不同）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:46
#: a01bb6e9b7ef4bf18f2f77c55dbe4289
msgid ""
"In the altitude controller, the Target ALT can also be modified by either "
"Terrain Data from the GCS or SD card if "
":ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` is enabled, and/or RangeFinder "
"altitude readings of distance above ground, if enabled and within the range "
"of the rangefinder. Note that in both cases, the displayed altitude in the "
"GCS HUD or OSD is the Estimated Altitude as long as EKF is working "
"(otherwise it will use BARO altitude relative to HOME)."
msgstr ""
"在高度控制器中，如果启用了 :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>`，目标高度还可以由来自 GCS 或 SD "
"卡的地形数据修正；如果测距仪已启用且在其量程范围内，还可以由测距仪的地面以上高度读数修正。注意，在这两种情况下，只要 EKF 正常工作，GCS HUD "
"或 OSD 中显示的高度均为估计高度（否则将使用相对于 Home 的气压计高度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:48
#: 38ab69ae4b324f40b3efce1e214eb4cd
msgid ""
"Sometimes the GPS ASL altitude is displayed prior to setting of the Origin "
"position in the EKF during ground initialization."
msgstr "有时在地面初始化期间设置 EKF 中的 Origin 位置之前，会显示 GPS ASL 高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:51
#: 1cdeb2b90cf34cc7b8ae45a63b53e727
msgid "Target ALT Modification using RangeFinder (RF)"
msgstr "使用测距仪（RF）修正目标高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:54
#: f0bd68f48f854e2299cf9cac1e3aba8f
msgid "Copter"
msgstr "Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:56
#: 48ba90ca24ff4364ac09b8cd9f73da74
msgid ""
"If a downward facing RangeFinder is enabled and within range, then the "
"Target ALT will be modified to use the RF's altitude measurements in Copter "
"and in VTOL modes of Plane."
msgstr "如果向下测距仪已启用且在量程范围内，则在 Copter 和 Plane 的 VTOL 模式中，目标高度将被修正为使用 RF 的高度测量值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:58
#: e515273a6a5147da8dd74f61b3b6395c
msgid ""
"For example, you are in ALTHOLD in Copter, hovering at 30m and out of the "
"RangeFinder's range. The Target ALT has been set to the current Estimated "
"ALT and will try to hold it. Now you descend using the throttle stick to 10m"
" and are now within the RF's range. When you release the stick, the Target "
"ALT will be set to the RF reported altitude. The Estimated Altitude is still"
" being used to adjust control outputs."
msgstr ""
"例如，您在 Copter 的 ALTHOLD 模式下，以 30m "
"高度悬停，此时超出测距仪量程。目标高度已设为当前估计高度并尝试保持。现在您用油门摇杆下降到 10m，进入 RF 量程。松开摇杆时，目标高度将设为 RF "
"报告的高度。估计高度仍用于调整控制输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:60
#: 1c61834c26e24ac18191b7a55ab62f82
msgid ""
"If the vehicle is moved over a ground object 1m tall. The Estimated ALT will"
" remain unchanged, since it's based on BARO, GPS ALT, etc. but the Target "
"ALT will be increased by 1M due to the RF readings showing 1m less distance "
"to the ground. Any changes in RF altitude are immediately reflected in the "
"Target ALT, so if the less accurate Estimated ALT erroneously varies a "
"little, the RF effectively immediately cancels that via Target ALT "
"adjustment, yielding more accurate altitude control."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器移动到 1m 高的地面物体上方，估计高度将保持不变（因为它基于气压计、GPS 高度等），但由于 RF 读数显示距地面距离减少 "
"1m，目标高度将增加 1m。RF 高度的任何变化会立即反映在目标高度中，因此如果精度较低的估计高度出现轻微误差，RF "
"会通过调整目标高度立即消除，从而实现更精确的高度控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:62
#: 9a2f6feb85cf42f3b88da5f508a47320
msgid ""
"If the RF's measurements change too rapidly (>2m for 3 reports), or the RF "
"moves out of range, then they will be ignored and current altitude from the "
"Estimated ALT set as new Target ALT. This prevents rapid climbs/descents "
"with fast moving RF data. It also means that tracking requiring large,rapid "
"changes, such as quickly approaching a tall object, will result in a "
"possible impact. See :ref:`Object Avoidance <common-object-avoidance-"
"landing-page>` in those cases."
msgstr ""
"如果 RF 测量值变化过快（3 次报告超过 2m），或 RF 超出量程，则 RF 数据将被忽略，并将当前估计高度设为新的目标高度。这可防止 RF "
"数据快速变化导致的急剧爬升/下降。这也意味着需要大幅快速变化的跟踪——如快速接近高大物体——可能导致碰撞。在这种情况下请参见 :ref:`Object "
"Avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:64
#: 840d4ed740dd41cfad44969880732372
msgid ""
"This is called :ref:`Surface Tracking <copter:terrain-following-manual-"
"modes>` in ArduPilot."
msgstr "这在 ArduPilot 中称为 :ref:`地面跟踪 <copter:terrain-following-manual-modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:66
#: e95e26dc2a1a47be87b9d426f8d1cd01
msgid ""
"Optionally (normally recommended only for indoor use), the RF can be used as"
" an additional sensor source for the EKF for altitude estimation. This is "
"normally only used when the only altitude sensor available is a RF, since "
"they have very limited range and more subject to environmental impacts to "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"可选地（通常仅建议在室内使用），RF 可作为 EKF 高度估计的附加传感器来源。通常仅在唯一可用的高度传感器是 RF 时才会使用，因为 RF "
"量程非常有限，且更易受环境影响而影响精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:69
#: 037defad0c664a63996660af10e6ea06
msgid "Plane"
msgstr "Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:71
#: 0b7b03ca2dce4014bf7f3bbd87a9bb10
msgid ""
"In Plane, when using fixed wing modes, RangeFinder use, when within range "
"and enabled by the :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` parameter, is "
"limited to:"
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 的固定翼模式下，测距仪在量程范围内且由 :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` "
"参数启用时，其用途仅限于："

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:73
#: 2ba6f148a70346249edd2ae8af3cebd7
msgid ""
"Adjusting glide slope during :ref:`Automatic Landings <automatic-landing>`, "
"during the approach and pre-flare phases of the landing."
msgstr "在 :ref:`自动降落 <automatic-landing>` 的进近和预拉平阶段调整下滑坡度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:74
#: 5071478f86da4c3193689477cf0de9de
msgid ""
"Determining altitude when :ref:`LGR_DEPLOY_ALT<LGR_DEPLOY_ALT>`, or "
":ref:`LGR_RETRACT_ALT<LGR_RETRACT_ALT>` is reached, if a downward facing RF "
"is active and within range."
msgstr ""
"当到达 :ref:`LGR_DEPLOY_ALT<LGR_DEPLOY_ALT>` 或 "
":ref:`LGR_RETRACT_ALT<LGR_RETRACT_ALT>` 高度时确定高度（如果向下测距仪已激活且在量程范围内）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:75
#: 37f7bdfe093247a4b427293a485b5dbf
msgid ""
"When :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` is reached in VTOL landings "
"in QuadPlane, if a downward facing RF is active."
msgstr ""
"当 QuadPlane 的 VTOL 降落中达到 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` "
"时（如果向下测距仪已激活）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:76
#: e6059a916d0d40b482b04065fcbf14e2
msgid "Determining if below :ref:`Q_ASSIST_ALT<Q_ASSIST_ALT>`."
msgstr "判断是否低于 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_ALT<Q_ASSIST_ALT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:77
#: e5051ae352c5477ebba67b50c7b2d406
msgid "Determining if below :ref:`Q_VFWD_ALT<Q_VFWD_ALT>`."
msgstr "判断是否低于 :ref:`Q_VFWD_ALT<Q_VFWD_ALT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:80
#: 32b2e8f14c1a48499c2e8fa69c8ab56a
msgid "Target ALT Modification using Terrain Following Data"
msgstr "使用地形跟随数据修正目标高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:82
#: e0431f0ad6064b4db290a67f39c3c3e6
msgid ""
"If Terrain Following is enabled and active, then the terrain altitude "
"changes are used to increase or decrease the Target ALT for whatever the "
"present location is, as it moves, depending on vehicle and mode. For details"
" see :ref:`common-terrain-following` for Plane or :ref:`terrain-following` "
"for Copter."
msgstr ""
"如果地形跟随已启用并处于激活状态，则地形高度变化将用于增加或减少当前位置的目标高度（随飞行器移动），具体取决于飞行器和模式。详情请参见 Plane 的 "
":ref:`common-terrain-following` 或 Copter 的 :ref:`terrain-following`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-understanding-altitude.rst:84
#: 5db99e7aff3040e289e54119ee514382
msgid ""
"For Copter, this can be combined with RangeFinder use for obtain "
":ref:`Surface Tracking<terrain-following-manual-modes>` over obstacles at "
"low altitudes."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter，可以与测距仪结合使用，以在低高度下实现对障碍物的 :ref:`地面跟踪<terrain-following-manual-"
"modes>`。"
